// 서산석림초등학교 (충남 서산시) - automatic high-school package (auto-school track, user decision 2026-10-23). Generated by scripts/campuses/seoklim/gen/build.mjs
// from OSM way/856215905 + AWS Terrain Tiles: every school building destructible (grammar models, floors estimated where OSM has none),
